<title>USA: Aerial Communications to enter Tampa market.</title>
<headline>Aerial Communications to enter Tampa market.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerial Communications Inc, a wireless communications company, said Monday it will enter the Tampa, Florida, market June 23.</p>
<p>In the first phase of the introduction, Aerial's service will be available to more than three million people in the area, with a further buildout to be completed later this year, Aerial said in a news release.</p>
<p>Aerial shares closed down 5/8 at 7-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
